figures.caption:
Figure 3: Gallery of exoALMA continuum images (using the robust parameter of $-0.5$) for the nine discs modelled in this work (Curone et al., 2025, data from). Shaded regions
indicate candidate outer pressure-substructure zones identified
from super-Keplerian velocity deviations in the Stadler et al. (2025)
rotation curve profiles, exterior to the observed dust disc;
pink and blue regions correspond to 12CO and 13CO selections respectively. The synthesised beam is shown in the
lower-left corner of each panel.
